# Tao Monthly Trends (repository)

As of: 2026-11-08T00:00:00Z; maturity_days: 14; minimum samples: 5
Terminal plans aged at least maturity_days at UTC day boundaries; active and never-started plans are censored. Months are UTC creation months [start, next month).
Planner-runtime attribution is low-confidence observational evidence, not implementation-runtime certainty or causal winners. Recorded outcomes are not proof of absence; cost is recorded telemetry, not guaranteed full cost.
Adjacent calendar month, same cohort only: rates require complete coverage, minimum samples and strictly non-overlapping Wilson 95% intervals for better/worse; otherwise inconclusive or unavailable (missing adjacent evidence/coverage). Medians have no directional verdict or interval.

